cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "Digesta TEI: A CTS-Addressable TEI P5 Dataset for Justinian's Digest"
abstract: >-
  A TEI P5 / EpiDoc XML dataset of all 50 books of Justinian's Digest, encoding 432 titles,
  9,139 juristic fragments and 21,077 sections, each citable by xml:id and CTS URN, with the
  inscriptio of every fragment and controlled jurist-attribution keys. Produced by the Digital
  Digesta project at Nagoya University from the Mommsen–Krüger editio maior (1868–1870).
